        "original_id": "8e3be680-1a17-5057-95a0-c415aa857452",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Annette Bening, Howard Deutch, John Hughes, Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Stephanie Faracy\n- Products: The Great Outdoors\n- Concepts: Academy Award nominations, Hollywood Walk of Fame\n\nFacts:\n- Annette Bening was born on May 29, 1958, and she is an American actress.\n- The Great Outdoors is a 1988 American comedy film directed by Howard Deutch and written and produced by John Hughes.\n- The Great Outdoors stars Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Stephanie Faracy, and Annette Bening in her film debut.\n- Annette Bening received Academy Award nominations for The Grifters in 1990, American Beauty in 1999, Being Julia in 2004, and The Kids Are All Right in 2010.\n- Annette Bening received a star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame in 2006.",
